%% Meridian Diagram 11: SSE Streaming Lifecycle
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Br as Browser
    participant AI as FastAPI SSE Endpoint
    participant R as Redis Stream
    participant LG as LangGraph Worker

    Br->>AI: GET /ai/stream/{job_id}?token=jwt
    AI->>AI: Validate JWT and open stream
    AI-->>Br: text/event-stream (open connection)

    loop Agent execution
      LG->>R: XADD job:{id}:events agent_update
      AI->>R: XREAD BLOCK 1000ms
      R-->>AI: event messages
      AI-->>Br: event: agent_update + data JSON
    end

    alt Job complete
      LG->>R: XADD type=job_complete, report_id
      AI->>R: XREAD next event
      R-->>AI: job_complete event
      AI-->>Br: event: job_complete
      Br->>Br: Navigate to /jobs/{id}/report
    else Job failed
      LG->>R: XADD type=job_failed, error
      AI-->>Br: event: job_failed
    end

    Note over AI,R: Stream key: job:{job_id}:events, TTL 24h
    Note over Br,AI: Frontend reconnects with exponential backoff (max 5)
